00:24.850 --> 00:26.950
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:26.950 --> 00:29.790
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.790 --> 00:32.520
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.520 --> 00:36.090
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.090 --> 00:37.260
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.260 --> 00:40.170
I was made to hit in America

00:40.170 --> 00:43.030
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.030 --> 00:48.940
I was made to hit in America

00:48.940 --> 00:52.610
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.610 --> 00:54.610
(To me, forever)

00:54.610 --> 00:58.320
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.320 --> 01:01.550
(To me, forever)

