01:25.280 --> 01:33.150
I was made to hit in America

01:36.190 --> 01:48.120
"Middle Schooler Ai Yamaguchi
to be youngest Triple Crown winner?"

01:54.070 --> 01:55.970
You heard of Beck?

01:57.940 --> 02:00.910
Never heard of them.

02:00.910 --> 02:03.280
I'll go get us some drinks.

02:05.150 --> 02:06.850
Beck, huh?

02:27.610 --> 02:30.400
Koyuki...Let's do it!

02:34.250 --> 02:36.380
I'm alright. I can do this!

02:36.380 --> 02:38.280
One, two...

02:50.060 --> 02:57.090
Typhoon! Typhoon 24! 24-7, non-stop!

02:57.090 --> 03:02.000
We're gonna rush at you!
Gonna send you flyin'!

03:02.000 --> 03:04.170
Lift up your heavy ass, now

03:04.170 --> 03:07.700
If you take off that stiff head
you'll feel totally loose

03:07.700 --> 03:09.070
This crazy, crazy world

03:09.070 --> 03:11.940
You just have to Stage Dive or Die

03:11.940 --> 03:13.840
Mind blower, a shower of sweat

03:13.840 --> 03:16.310
Run towards a new world, my life

03:16.310 --> 03:18.750
Those who seek it will be rewarded

03:18.750 --> 03:22.290
Pass the hot shot,
keep on coming, come on!

03:22.290 --> 03:24.590
Blow your mind

03:24.590 --> 03:27.160
Squeeze your sweat yeah

03:27.160 --> 03:29.530
-Blow your mind

03:27.160 --> 03:29.530
-Koyuki! Look up, will you?!

03:29.530 --> 03:31.360
-Squeeze your sweat

03:29.530 --> 03:31.360
-Koyuki! Look up, will you?!

03:31.360 --> 03:32.730
Find the way you are,

03:32.730 --> 03:33.830
-spice of your life

03:32.730 --> 03:33.830
-Yeah!

03:33.830 --> 03:36.270
Heavy beat, hey come on people

03:36.270 --> 03:38.600
Find the way you are,
spice of your life

03:38.600 --> 03:41.900
Heavy beat, hey come on people yeah

03:43.370 --> 03:47.070
Take your spice yeah

03:48.280 --> 03:51.040
Find my wife

04:03.130 --> 04:06.030
-It's no good.
-Huh?

04:06.030 --> 04:09.930
Look at them. They're all
just holding up the walls.

04:13.400 --> 04:17.040
I don't know...

04:17.040 --> 04:20.980
At this rate, they may
be better off with Togo.

04:20.980 --> 04:22.770
What do you think, sis?

04:29.350 --> 04:30.820
Yeah!

04:32.460 --> 04:36.480
Put your hands up, up, up, up!

04:40.130 --> 04:42.000
Yeah, check it out!

04:42.000 --> 04:45.040
Let's go concrete hell,
human safari park escape

04:45.040 --> 04:46.340
Ape in the brain,

04:46.340 --> 04:48.970
mass brain-washing operation,
no thank you

04:48.970 --> 04:52.180
Let's walk together, step in step,
and we'll get stuck in the deep

04:52.180 --> 04:55.580
We're at the rebellious age,
free as we go

04:55.580 --> 04:59.980
This is no barrier, just what is important,
nothing impure, just clear

04:59.980 --> 05:02.620
No pressure at our pace,
I'm not joining that race

05:02.620 --> 05:04.350
Yo! Still got complaints?

05:04.350 --> 05:08.420
We're fools, just fools,
but everyone's a top-class mother fucker

05:13.560 --> 05:20.070
Fly with god of wind,
here we go all amigos

05:20.070 --> 05:23.440
Fly with god of wind,

05:23.440 --> 05:24.110
here we go all amigos

05:24.110 --> 05:27.610
"Triple Crown event planned.
Appearance in TV drama soon..."

05:24.110 --> 05:27.610
here we go all amigos

05:27.610 --> 05:30.710
"Triple Crown event planned.
Appearance in TV drama soon..."

05:27.610 --> 05:30.710
Who? Who? Foojin, takes me cruisin'

05:30.710 --> 05:32.350
"Triple Crown event planned.
Appearance in TV drama soon..."

05:30.710 --> 05:32.350
Music that cuts through the wind,

05:32.350 --> 05:33.920
"Triple Crown event planned.
Appearance in TV drama soon..."

05:32.350 --> 05:33.920
free form

05:33.920 --> 05:35.850
"Triple Crown event planned.
Appearance in TV drama soon..."

05:33.920 --> 05:35.850
Who? Who? Foojin

05:44.660 --> 05:51.030
I'm really holding everybody back...
My guitar-playing sucks...

05:51.030 --> 05:55.270
But Ryusuke said you did well
for a first-timer.

05:55.270 --> 06:00.230
Maybe Saku did,
but my guitar was the worst...

06:01.950 --> 06:05.950
I'll bet he'll never ask me again.

06:05.950 --> 06:09.250
Koyuki, do you have something
around your neck?

06:09.250 --> 06:13.590
This? I always have it on.
You never noticed it?

06:13.590 --> 06:15.360
No...

06:15.360 --> 06:19.300
See. It's Eddy's pick-the one you gave me.

06:19.300 --> 06:21.530
It's my good luck charm.

06:47.590 --> 06:50.750
Maho...This song...

07:00.700 --> 07:03.140
Oh, that...

07:03.140 --> 07:07.540
It's a new song. It's still unfinished.

07:07.540 --> 07:10.580
The one recorded after our performance?

07:10.580 --> 07:16.110
True, it's a nice song,
but Chiba's voice is too "punk" to sing it.

07:17.650 --> 07:20.710
I'll never sing a gloomy song like that!

07:24.090 --> 07:25.530
Hello...

07:26.730 --> 07:27.700
Um...

07:27.700 --> 07:28.930
Yo!

07:32.740 --> 07:36.700
That song...Won't you let me sing it?

07:38.880 --> 07:40.000
-Huh?!
-Huh?!
-Huh?!

07:52.660 --> 07:56.490
Ryusuke-kun...Does this song have a title?

07:56.490 --> 08:01.860
Yeah, but just a tentative one.
I call it "Face."

08:03.370 --> 08:08.470
This song...It's about Maho, isn't it?

08:08.470 --> 08:10.100
Mhm...

08:47.480 --> 08:55.950
Large lips keeping motion,
trying to keep blaming on

08:55.950 --> 09:00.520
When I say reason I'm late on

09:00.520 --> 09:04.890
Find you turning, laughing and smiling

09:04.890 --> 09:07.130
Sing it up,

09:07.130 --> 09:09.270
-my sister
-Huh?

09:09.270 --> 09:13.540
In this world which everyone is lonely

09:13.540 --> 09:20.780
Everything will be fine someday

09:20.780 --> 09:24.740
Some other day

09:29.190 --> 09:31.990
Not bad!

09:31.990 --> 09:36.730
Taira-kun! What now?! Are you
still against letting Koyuki join?

09:36.730 --> 09:38.490
Jesus Christ...

09:38.490 --> 09:41.460
No. I'm not against it.

09:41.460 --> 09:45.970
It's true, when Ryusuke first
wanted to let Koyuki in,

09:45.970 --> 09:48.070
I thought it was too soon.

09:48.070 --> 09:53.340
And you can't say he did well
at our live performance.

09:53.340 --> 10:00.410
But I'm sure of it now.
This band is gonna make it big.

10:02.220 --> 10:05.520
Of course, we'll never
make it as we are now.

10:11.530 --> 10:18.700
There are countless other bands
out there. So how do we make it?

10:18.700 --> 10:22.840
I had absolutely no idea...

10:22.840 --> 10:29.480
But...after listening to
Koyuki's song just now, I got it.

10:29.480 --> 10:30.810
That's right.

10:30.810 --> 10:36.290
If we set a spark to the chemistry
the five of us have, we can do it!

10:36.290 --> 10:40.620
-"The...
...five of us?"

10:40.620 --> 10:43.560
You guys're part of Beck, too!

10:50.700 --> 10:55.310
By any chance, with a new vocalist
on board...Am I fired?

10:55.310 --> 10:59.440
Idiot! Without you, our live shows
won't have any excitement!

10:59.440 --> 11:03.880
I can play the guitar, you know!
I can do Big Blue Hearts or Crush...

11:03.880 --> 11:05.810
Ryusuke-chan? You listening?

11:07.920 --> 11:09.180
Hey...

12:01.170 --> 12:05.810
-They're working real hard.
-Yeah.

12:05.810 --> 12:08.800
Koyuki...You gotta work harder...

12:45.780 --> 12:49.890
Boy, that all-nighter
on Saturday was rough...

12:49.890 --> 12:52.560
When I got home, I just zonked out.

12:52.560 --> 12:55.960
And I broke my sleep record.

12:55.960 --> 12:58.900
Saku, have you heard
Dying Breed's new song?

12:58.900 --> 13:01.500
I heard it on an FM station.

13:01.500 --> 13:03.800
It sure is a great song.

13:03.800 --> 13:06.360
I sort of learned it by ear.

13:35.400 --> 13:37.060
Let's go, Saku...

13:47.740 --> 13:51.250
Those guys...
Fooling around with that guitar...

13:51.250 --> 13:55.380
He's gotten too big for his britches
ever since that swim meet.

13:55.380 --> 13:58.480
Did you recognize it? That song...

14:00.660 --> 14:06.490
"I Call You Love."
It's Dying Breed's newest song.

14:14.740 --> 14:16.970
Huh? What?

14:16.970 --> 14:19.410
A live house?

14:20.980 --> 14:22.710
There's no way!

14:22.710 --> 14:24.710
But, I'm going to sing...

14:24.710 --> 14:26.480
Well, you know...

14:26.480 --> 14:30.290
The kind of music I like is...

14:30.290 --> 14:34.360
The Beatles and the Yardbirds...
and the early Stones.

14:34.360 --> 14:37.260
And the Rocket Boys!

14:37.260 --> 14:39.660
Yeah, I know, but...

14:39.660 --> 14:42.130
Sorry, but I have absolutely
no interest in anything

14:42.130 --> 14:45.030
other than British beat
from the good old days.

14:45.030 --> 14:51.240
That's too bad...I wanted you
to hear my singing.

14:51.240 --> 14:56.680
I guess the only one who'll come...
is Momoko-sensei, I guess.

14:56.680 --> 14:58.050
I'll come!

14:58.050 --> 15:01.480
I'll pay you 1000 yen an hour,
so please bring Momoko-sensei!

15:01.480 --> 15:04.110
Please! Please! Please!

15:13.830 --> 15:17.630
Yukio...Yukio!

15:34.950 --> 15:37.350
Oh, sorry!

15:41.220 --> 15:44.090
Oh, it's you.

15:49.630 --> 15:56.510
I heard from Masaru...
He says you're in a band.

15:56.510 --> 16:00.810
Uh...We have a rehearsal,
so I've got to get going.

16:00.810 --> 16:03.610
I don't give a damn about that.

16:03.610 --> 16:05.620
But...

16:05.620 --> 16:08.740
Hey...Let me play that guitar.

16:10.920 --> 16:13.650
It's probably just a rinky-dink band.

16:16.930 --> 16:18.520
What the hell is this?

16:21.330 --> 16:24.370
You think you're so hot...

16:24.370 --> 16:26.130
Hands off!

16:30.070 --> 16:34.200
Damn you! Watch how you talk to me!

16:44.590 --> 16:46.680
You'll pay for that...

16:48.590 --> 16:51.130
Huh?

16:51.130 --> 16:55.760
You'll pay for that!

16:57.700 --> 17:01.830
So what're you gonna do, bastard?

17:13.980 --> 17:15.080
Damn!

17:15.080 --> 17:18.780
Damn you! I'll kill you!

17:22.330 --> 17:24.920
Alright! That's enough!

17:26.330 --> 17:29.730
-Can't stand to see anyone being bullied.
-Ray! Koyuki's in trouble!

17:29.730 --> 17:32.700
Yeah. We're in the back street
near the parking.

17:32.700 --> 17:34.930
-Yeah, yeah, hurry!
-Chiba-kun!

17:35.870 --> 17:39.810
Koyuki, I like your spirit.

17:44.880 --> 17:47.080
Who the hell are you?

17:47.080 --> 17:52.520
I can't forgive thickheaded guys
who can't understand others' pain.

17:55.460 --> 17:59.230
I just called them on my cell phone!
They'll be here soon!

17:59.230 --> 18:01.000
Chiba-kun!

18:01.000 --> 18:02.960
Just watch.

18:19.950 --> 18:23.850
I hear Chiba was always bullied
when he was little.

18:36.230 --> 18:37.700
Chiba!

18:50.080 --> 18:55.040
Can you believe it? Until Chiba
learned karate, he was a crybaby.

18:57.590 --> 19:00.460
That was a sucker kick...

19:00.460 --> 19:03.520
Shut up! This one's for Koyuki!

19:16.170 --> 19:18.140
Okay...

19:18.140 --> 19:21.580
One, two, three!

19:21.580 --> 19:23.480
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

19:29.720 --> 19:32.790
You're Ryusuke-kun
of Serial Mama, aren't you?

19:32.790 --> 19:34.520
Huh?

19:34.520 --> 19:39.360
My sempai is a friend
of bass player Yamagishi-kun.

19:39.360 --> 19:45.230
He got me on the guest list once
and I went to see you.

19:45.230 --> 19:52.140
I was impressed by your guitar.
You were a Japanese Jimmy Page!

19:55.340 --> 19:58.540
I'll get even with you one of these days.

20:02.050 --> 20:04.580
Sure! Any day!

20:20.170 --> 20:22.540
Look at what he did...

20:29.880 --> 20:32.550
Koyuki...Are you alright?

20:32.550 --> 20:35.780
Yeah. I'm fine.

20:35.780 --> 20:39.550
When Eddy comes to Japan,
I'll get something else of his for you.

20:41.860 --> 20:43.230
Maho...

20:43.230 --> 20:46.730
But I'm here to hear "Face" today.

20:46.730 --> 20:49.720
-Do your best, now.
-Yeah.

20:50.900 --> 20:54.200
Do you feel the pressure?

20:54.200 --> 20:55.900
Not at all.

21:00.280 --> 21:01.900
Alright!

21:03.610 --> 21:10.920
Let's take that live house by storm!

21:10.920 --> 21:12.750
-Yeah!
-Yeah!
-Alright!

21:27.470 --> 21:29.140
How's the bass?

21:29.140 --> 21:32.840
-Can you bring it down some?
-You got it.

21:36.880 --> 21:39.070
Let's do the guitar next.

21:41.350 --> 21:44.880
-How is it?
-Yeah, that's about right.

22:06.040 --> 22:10.980
"Dying Breed-Japan Visit Slated!!!"

22:10.980 --> 22:19.590
"Dying Breed-Japan Visit Slated!!!"

22:10.980 --> 22:19.590
Large lips in the motion,
trying to keep blaming on

22:19.590 --> 22:24.160
"Dying Breed-Japan Visit Slated!!!"

22:19.590 --> 22:24.160
As I say reason I'm late on

22:24.160 --> 22:28.860
Find you turning, laughing and smiling

22:50.240 --> 22:52.340
Another minute

22:52.340 --> 22:55.040
Feelin' so fine

22:57.350 --> 22:59.580
You turn the freeze

22:59.580 --> 23:02.310
into warm light

23:04.420 --> 23:07.990
Had a premonition

23:07.990 --> 23:10.690
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.690 --> 23:14.200
My world comin' down

23:14.200 --> 23:16.990
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.770 --> 23:24.940
If you really wanna fly

23:24.940 --> 23:27.700
you gotta let go

23:39.960 --> 23:42.290
Simply the most

23:42.290 --> 23:44.330
big sensation

23:44.330 --> 23:47.130
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.130 --> 23:49.400
She's really pretty

23:49.400 --> 23:51.400
One-eyed vision

23:51.400 --> 23:54.240
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.240 --> 23:57.740
Little sister showed me

23:57.740 --> 24:00.410
Really took me for a ride

24:00.410 --> 24:02.080
My world comin' down

24:02.080 --> 24:05.410
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.410 --> 24:09.440
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:13.620 --> 24:16.160
I got chilled and caught a cold.

24:16.160 --> 24:16.630
"Next Episode"

24:16.160 --> 24:16.630
I got chilled and caught a cold.

